2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":10,"created_at":"2025-03-13T16:42:41Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T14:58:21Z","closed_at":"2025-04-01T00:03:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- reproducible in (Linux) Godot Engine – .NET4.4\n- partly reproducible in (Linux) Godot Engine  – .NET4.3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable.mono - Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS 22.04 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - llvmpipe (LLVM 15.0.7, 256 bits) - AMD EPYC 7763 64-Core Processor (4 threads) \n\nGodot v4.3.stable.mono - Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS 22.04 - X11 - GLES3 (Compatibility) - llvmpipe (LLVM 15.0.7, 256 bits) - AMD EPYC 7763 64-Core Processor (4 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using external code editors (Rider, VS code) and debugging GDscript files, the whole session crashes if any of the breakpoints are removed. The editor crashes at the same time. \nThe issue is similar for the 4.3 version of Godot, but in Rider the session and the editor crash only if you remove the breakpoint that was hit. \nThe issue is DAP-specific. Doesn't reproduce on Windows.\n\nthe launch.json file for visual studio code:\n\n```\n{\n    \"version\": \"0.2.0\",\n    \"configurations\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"GDScript Godot\",\n            \"type\": \"godot\",\n            \"request\": \"launch\",\n            \"project\": \"${workspaceFolder}\",\n            \"port\": 6007,\n            \"debugServer\": 6006,\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the solution with GDScript files in Rider or VS code.\n2. Create breakpoint in a .gd file that would be running when the debugging session begins. \n3. Start a debugging session (in DAP mode) with GDScript configuration. \n4. Hit a breakpoint.\n5. Remove any of the breakpoints in the script.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104078/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104078/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}